      "content": "idk i feel like \"moderation\" is kind of vague. if i have like a couple slices of salami or a little bit of cheddar on my sandwich, is that really gonna cause a problem? i'm not eating a whole block of cheese at once lol. it's just for flavor and protein. is it actually dangerous or just something doctors say to be safe?",
